---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Seen in Korea Desk — SEEN IN KOREA"
  description="Meet the SEEN IN KOREA editorial desk and learn how our reporting is researched, verified and published."
>
  <main>
    <section class="listing-hero">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="eyebrow">SEEN IN KOREA</div>
        <h1>SEEN IN KOREA DESK</h1>
        <p>
          The editorial desk behind SEEN IN KOREA's reporting on Korean culture,
          consumer trends, products and everyday life.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section>
      <div class="article-wrap article-body">

        <h2>About the desk</h2>
        <p>
          The Seen in Korea Desk researches and publishes English-language reporting
          for international readers interested in Korea.
        </p>

        <h2>What we cover</h2>
        <p>
          Our coverage includes K-culture, entertainment, K-beauty, Korean products,
          retail and consumer trends, travel, and the experiences of people living in
          or visiting Korea.
        </p>

        <h2>How we work</h2>
        <p>
          We prioritize primary sources, official data, direct interviews and
          verifiable evidence. Claims, campaigns and confirmed facts are distinguished
          where relevant.
        </p>

        <h2>Editorial standards</h2>
        <p>
          Read more about our verification, corrections and commercial disclosure policies:
          <a href="/editorial-standards">Editorial Standards →</a>
        </p>

        <h2>Contact</h2>
        <p>
          Editorial inquiries, corrections and story tips:
          <a href="mailto:seeninkorea@gmail.com">seeninkorea@gmail.com</a>
        </p>

      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
